{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13806","headline":"湖南客中春望 · 顾况","name":"湖南客中春望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣雁嘹嘹北向频，渌波何处是通津。\n风尘海内怜双鬓，涕泪天涯惨一身。\n故里音书应望绝，异乡景物又更新。\n便抛印绶从归隐，吴渚香蓴漫吐春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}